   <media:title>The Keith Haring Collection | LOUIS VUITTON</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/f4v7uAepfnY?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/f4v7uAepfnY/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>The Keith Haring Collection. A graphic composition of emblematic figures and Louis Vuitton's savoir-faire underscores a vibrant collection — perpetuating a narrative of the Louis Vuitton woman conceived by Nicolas Ghesquière, guided by the vivacious energy of New York City. Access the preorder on December 23rd, ahead of the global launch at http://on.louisvuitton.com/6001ByVUE5

The campaign video is shot in Keith Haring’s former studio and soundtracked by New York photographer and multidisciplinary artist Lynn Goldsmith, under the alias Will Powers, her satirical musical project launched in 1983. A contemporary of Haring in New York’s vibrant 1980s art scene, Goldsmith photographed the artist on several occasions, capturing some of his most recognizable portraits.

#KeithHaring #NicolasGhesquiere #LouisVuitton

